[
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:0.1", "PA_snp_5.9:0.2", "PA_snp_5.9:1.1"], "en": "Sutta Nipāta 5.9 The Young Brahmin Hemaka’s Question “Those who previously gave me an explanation...”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.2"], "en": "(Thus spoke the Venerable Hemaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.3"], "en": "\"Beyond the teaching of Gotama,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.4"], "en": "'It was thus' or 'It will be thus'— [there is nothing else].\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.5"], "en": "All that is merely \"thus it has been said\";", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.6"], "en": "all that is an increase of mere reasoning;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:1.7"], "en": "in that, I found no delight.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:2.1", "PA_snp_5.9:2.2"], "en": "And you, O Sage, declare to me the Dhamma that destroys craving,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:2.3"], "en": "by knowing which one may live mindful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:2.4"], "en": "Cross over the attachment to the world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:3.1", "PA_snp_5.9:3.2"], "en": "Here, Hemaka, regarding things seen, heard, sensed, and cognized that are dear and pleasing—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:3.3"], "en": "The dispelling of sensual lust,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:3.4"], "en": "the deathless state of Nibbāna—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:4.1"], "en": "having understood this, those who are mindful...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:4.2"], "en": "Having attained extinction in this very life,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:4.3"], "en": "they are forever at peace,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:4.4"], "en": "having crossed over attachment to the world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_snp_5.9:4.5"], "en": "The eighth is the interrogation of the youth Hemaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
